[{"id":"fastapi-0141-authn-vs-authz","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["认证","授权"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全","articlePath":"posts/f30a7c3d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(七)认证授权与接口安全","articlePath":"posts/f30a7c3d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>认证与授权为什么必须分两步？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>认证确认主体是谁，授权根据角色、scope 和资源规则决定该主体能否执行当前动作。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>只验证 token 只能说明签发者认可这个主体，不能说明它可以读取另一个账号的任务或审计数据。先解析 subject 并校验签名/过期，再执行角色、scope 和资源所有权检查；缺少凭证通常是 401，凭证有效但权限不足是 403。把两步混成一个布尔值会让日志、OpenAPI 和错误处理都失去边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-sync-db-in-async","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["异步","阻塞"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>async def\u003c/code> 中的同步数据库调用仍会阻塞？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>事件循环只会在遇到可等待的异步 I/O 时让出控制权；同步驱动会一直占住当前线程。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>把函数声明成 \u003ccode>async\u003c/code> 不会改变同步库的实现。慢查询期间，事件循环无法处理同一进程的其他请求，延迟会同时上升。优先使用匹配的异步驱动；若暂时只能用同步驱动，显式放入线程并限制并发，再用无关健康请求的延迟实验验证没有阻塞主循环。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-sse-vs-websocket","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["SSE","WebSocket"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信","articlePath":"posts/6be6843f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十一)流式响应与实时通信","articlePath":"posts/6be6843f/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十五)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十五)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/dfdedcc6/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>SSE 与 WebSocket 应按哪些轴选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>单向服务端事件和浏览器原生重连优先 SSE；需要双向消息、低延迟交互或自定义帧协议时选择 WebSocket。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SSE 仍是 HTTP，事件包含 \u003ccode>id\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>event\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>data\u003c/code>，浏览器 \u003ccode>EventSource\u003c/code> 会按协议重连；它不适合客户端频繁向服务端发送消息。WebSocket 先握手再双向收发，但需要自己定义认证、心跳、关闭码、广播和恢复。两者都要处理取消、慢消费者和代理超时，连接类型不能代替业务状态设计。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a11-getopts","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["getopts","参数"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>getopts 解析完成后为什么要执行 shift “$((OPTIND - 1))”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它跳过已消费的选项，使剩余位置参数成为业务函数的真实输入。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>getopts\u003c/code> 解析时会把游标保存在 \u003ccode>OPTIND\u003c/code>：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">OPTIND=1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">while\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">getopts\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;:n:v&#x27;\u003c/span> opt; \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">do\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">case\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$opt\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    n) name=\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$OPTARG\u003c/span> ;;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    v) verbose=1 ;;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    :) \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;option -%s needs a value\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$OPTARG\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> &gt;&amp;2; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">exit\u003c/span> 2 ;;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \\?) \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;unknown option -%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$OPTARG\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> &gt;&amp;2; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">exit\u003c/span> 2 ;;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">esac\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">done\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">shift\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"subst\">$((OPTIND - 1)\u003c/span>)&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;business-arg=&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$1\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>shift\u003c/code> 后，\u003ccode>$@\u003c/code> 才只剩下业务参数；不 shift 会让已消费的 \u003ccode>-n\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>-v\u003c/code> 再次进入业务逻辑。缺少值或未知选项应返回非零并显示用法，不能把错误当成普通位置参数。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-03-guarded-update-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["UPDATE","预览","影响行数"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(三)数据写入与约束.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(三)数据写入与约束","articlePath":"posts/4df9aab4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(三)数据写入与约束.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(三)数据写入与约束","articlePath":"posts/4df9aab4/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>请把 2026-08-01 之前仍为 pending 的订单取消，并保证误选时可以回滚。SQL 步骤是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">START\u003c/span> TRANSACTION;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;pending&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-08-01&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SET\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;cancelled&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;pending&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-08-01&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> ROW_COUNT();\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\">-- 结果异常 ROLLBACK，否则 COMMIT\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>安全性来自可复现的条件和事务证据，而不是某个客户端开关：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">同一 WHERE 预览目标\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">START TRANSACTION → UPDATE → ROW_COUNT()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ↓                 ↘ 行数/回读异常 → ROLLBACK\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        └────────────────── 正常 → COMMIT\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>预览和修改必须复用同一 \u003ccode>WHERE\u003c/code>，并按主键保存目标集合；\u003ccode>sql_safe_updates\u003c/code> 只是额外阻拦，不会替你验证业务条件。影响行数异常时先回滚，再查连接是否仍在同一个事务。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-error-text-binary","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","文件","编码","bytes","str"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>文本和二进制文件处理的关键边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>文本使用 \u003ccode>str\u003c/code> 和明确编码，二进制使用 \u003ccode>bytes\u003c/code>；读取时 decode，写出时 encode。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>文本接口读写 \u003ccode>str\u003c/code>，二进制接口读写 \u003ccode>bytes\u003c/code>，编码转换必须发生在边界处：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">from\u003c/span> pathlib \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> Path\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">path = Path(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;message.txt&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">path.write_text(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;你好\\n&quot;\u003c/span>, encoding=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">text = path.read_text(encoding=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">raw = path.read_bytes()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(text, raw)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># str 与 bytes 是两种不同对象\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>Path\u003c/code> 负责路径组合，\u003ccode>with\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>Path\u003c/code> 方法负责关闭文件；遇到 \u003ccode>UnicodeDecodeError\u003c/code> 时先核对真实编码和数据来源，不要默认用 replacement 丢失原始信息。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]